win","html_url":"https://github.com/petebacondarwin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2015-12-22T16:49:08Z","updated_at":"2019-09-08T00:20:36Z","closed_at":"2016-02-09T00:19:16Z","assignee":{"login":"petebacondarwin","id":15655,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15655?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin","html_url":"https://github.com/petebacondarwin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"- **Issue**: ngComponentRouter, in the outlet directive will place the component name as an attribute on a div tag, instead of creating an element for it\n- Using Angular 1.5\n- Building ngComponentRouter from current angular master\n- **Motivation/Use Case**: Exploring migration of ui-router to the ngComponentRouter \n\nLooking at the [ngOutlet](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/604c8bbad54ffbcec1d6a5e407821adda8a74a19/modules/angular1_router/src/ng_outlet.ts#L158)\n\n``` javascript\nthis.controller.$$template = '<div ' + dashCase(componentName) + '></div>';\n```\n\nIf using a `.directive`, restrict needs to be `AE` as a result, if I am using `.component`, then the element won't display at all, assuming that behind the scenes it only works for elements, not attributes. \n\nChanging the line to something like:\n\n``` javascript\nvar dashName =  dashCase(componentName)\nthis.controller.$$template = '<' + dashName + '>' + '</' + dashName + '>' \n```\n\nseems to work. \n\nAlso a consideration when working with ngUpgrade, as the comments [indicate that restrict must be 'E'](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/1b78342e23f00ed5c6494e7d192a7356c841d7cb/modules/angular2/src/upgrade/upgrade_adapter.ts#L209) \n","closed_by":{"login":"IgorMinar","id":216296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjI5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar","html_url":"https://github.com/IgorMinar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscription